", "uri": "https://scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974685_1840524873122821_3055739933188055904_n.png?_nc_cat=101&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=6jkQRTZ1GJ0Q7kNvwH6TZoT&_nc_oc=AdrqtlmrnxXKGlOHUjyYLRk7ngAtz9TzF0_evxZXYv7HqUyPrYPQYE3qHnAg4HzkyyM&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea1-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af4kbdK4opNPokUTYy9ljRGIAXkC38Hml3B8jbg0mW9niw&oe=6A15A279"}, {"file_name": "5.png", "id": "3474397939524850", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38974494_3474397942858183_7325370313459975246_n.png?_nc_cat=110&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=dkCrGgd1ZUsQ7kNvwFV9inz&_nc_oc=AdrpUNZ-lXPhxZT1pPcr7MQRvWZdieUZBWfkYON57ML1ZH6aqIKM5zGF-LhxX2A97r8&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af7ksNGrkoXxZ9bppYPpInFw4ZPKrBM4axZbEq6lW3UqIg&oe=6A15B94B"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "Hard Drive Logo (6).png", "id": "1060475455596738", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/38984476_1060475458930071_8663595066419356644_n.png?_nc_cat=103&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=nOosAIi8KO8Q7kNvwHC0O-5&_nc_oc=AdouOXtIy-eSXY7qrKQjmoo1FJxz3HAc_Im63n7_KERDh9usSPsGzatWTpEsfa-wSVk&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_Af6Tg0Q0iufFKLKNXt6LwEcY_Mh7f6XSE8_VLAj3Xti8MA&oe=6A15B7CE"}, "display_name": "Hard Drive", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# *Hard Drive* \n\nHard Drive is a fast-paced, multiplayer, competitive electro combat driving game. Players control sleek, neon-lit motorcycle looking vehicles, known as bykes, which leave behind a temporary solid trail of light as they move. Players must outmaneuver their opponents by creating a trails of light that they cannot avoid crashing into, while avoiding the trails left by other players.\n\n# _Current Features_\n- Non PvP Driving Park\n- 6 Player Combat Arena\n- Season Pass with Progression Rewards\n- Cosmetic Shop \n\n## More Coming Soon. . .", "short_description": "Electro Combat Driving "}]}, "devel